"02:54.015" end="02:55.063">gaino</span><span begin="02:55.063" end="02:55.437">chi</span><span begin="02:55.437" end="02:56.350">wokakeru</span><span begin="02:56.350" end="02:57.221">kara</span><span begin="02:57.221" end="02:58.008"></span><span begin="02:58.008" end="02:59.378"></span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="02:59.319" end="03:00.464">anatawa</span><span begin="03:00.464" end="03:01.506">jika</span><span begin="03:01.506" end="03:01.991">nwo</span><span begin="03:01.991" end="03:02.745">kureta</span><span begin="03:02.745" end="03:03.111">no</span><span begin="03:03.111" end="03:04.458">deshou?</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="03:04.509" end="03:05.307">arayuru</span><span begin="03:05.692" end="03:06.785">nozomino</span><span begin="03:06.785" end="03:07.527">su</span><span begin="03:07.527" end="03:08.290">bete</span><span begin="03:08.290" end="03:09.151">wokanae</span><span begin="03:09.151" end="03:09.608">ta</span><span begin="03:09.608" end="03:10.051">ra</span><span begin="03:10.051" end="03:11.334"></span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="03:12.213" end="03:13.284">anatani</span><span begin="03:13.284" end="03:14.883">aitai</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="03:14.787" end="03:16.014">hoshininegai</span><span begin="03:16.014" end="03:16.706">wokake</span><span begin="03:16.706" end="03:17.853">te</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="03:17.633" end="03:18.186">sa</span><span begin="03:18.186" end="03:19.245">ahoshinokota</span><span begin="03:19.245" end="03:19.954">chiyo</span><span begin="03:20.178" end="03:20.712"></span><span begin="03:20.712" end="03:21.550"></span><span begin="03:21.550" end="03:22.047"></span><span begin="03:22.047" end="03:23.057"></span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="03:24.352" end="03:25.380">kagayaki</span><span begin="03:25.380" end="03:26.475">waniburanai</span><span begin="03:26.723" end="03:27.393"></span><span begin="03:27.393" end="03:27.942"></span><span begin="03:27.942" end="03:28.530"></span><span begin="03:28.530" end="03:29.562"></span></text><text for="L40"><span begin="03:30.449" end="03:31.013">sa</span><span begin="03:31.013" end="03:32.076">ahoshinokota</span><span begin="03:32.076" end="03:32.586">chiyo</span><span begin="03:33.027" end="03:33.522"></span><span begin="03:33.522" end="03:34.513"></span><span begin="03:34.513" end="03:35.145"></span><span begin="03:35.145" end="03:36.168"></span></text><text for="L41"><span begin="03:37.105" end="03:38.039">matataki</span><span begin="03:38.039" end="03:39.093">woyurusana</span><span begin="03:39.394" end="03:40.180">i</span><span begin="03:40.180" end="03:40.901"></span><span begin="03:40.901" end="03:41.638"></span><span begin="03:41.638" end="03:43.191"></span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:47.333"><div begin="00:30.209" end="03:43.191"><p begin="00:30.209" end="00:33.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:30.209" end="00:31.507">ラストチャンスに</span><span begin="00:31.507" end="00:32.189">飢えた</span><span begin="00:32.189" end="00:32.947">つま先</span><span begin="00:32.947" end="00:33.570">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踮起脚尖渴求最后的机遇</span></p><p begin="00:33.580" end="00:36.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:33.580" end="00:34.833">踊り出すまま</span><span begin="00:34.833" end="00:35.482">駆けた</span><span begin="00:35.482" end="00:35.875">この</span><span begin="00:35.875" end="00:36.745">夜空</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出舞步纵情驰骋于夜空</span></p><p begin="00:36.755" end="00:39.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:36.755" end="00:37.222">並の</span><span begin="00:37.222" end="00:38.070">スタンスじゃ</span><span begin="00:38.070" end="00:38.841">靡かな</span><span begin="00:38.841" end="00:39.385">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立于相同立场则坚定不移</span></p><p begin="00:39.395" end="00:43.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:39.395" end="00:39.934">星は</span><span begin="00:39.983" end="00:41.221">宝石の</span><span begin="00:41.221" end="00:41.829">憧</span><span begin="00:41.829" end="00:43.047">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰是宝石们的憧憬</span></p><p begin="00:43.163" end="00:46.369" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:43.163" end="00:44.264">浮かぶ涙と</span><span begin="00:44.367" end="00:44.955">汗は</span><span begin="00:44.955" end="00:45.316">血の</span><span begin="00:45.316" end="00:45.858">名残</span><span begin="00:45.858" end="00:46.369">り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飞溅挥洒的汗与泪是血的遗痕</span></p><p begin="00:46.369" end="00:49.584" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:46.369" end="00:47.663">目の中でしか</span><span begin="00:47.663" end="00:48.692">泳げなきゃ</span><span begin="00:48.692" end="00:49.584">芝居</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅游离于眼眸中的逢场作戏</span></p><p begin="00:49.584" end="00:52.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:49.584" end="00:50.117">だけど</span><span begin="00:50.117" end="00:50.807">ステージが</span><span begin="00:50.807" end="00:51.731">逃がさな</span><span begin="00:51.731" end="00:52.184">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但舞台上的每分每秒绝不失误</span></p><p begin="00:52.184" end="00:55.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:52.184" end="00:52.999">いついつ</span><span begin="00:52.999" end="00:53.647">までも</span><span begin="00:53.949" end="00:54.735">憧</span><span begin="00:54.735" end="00:55.918">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时时刻刻永远心怀渴望</span></p><p begin="00:55.930" end="00:58.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:55.930" end="00:56.600">焦がれて</span><span begin="00:56.600" end="00:57.109">いる</span><span begin="00:57.109" end="00:58.353">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心驰神往</span></p><p begin="00:57.369" end="01:00.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:57.369" end="00:57.708">I've</span> <span begin="00:57.708" end="00:58.201">never</span> <span begin="00:58.201" end="00:58.703">seen</span> <span begin="00:58.917" end="00:59.242">such</span> <span begin="00:59.242" end="00:59.456">a</span> <span begin="00:59.456" end="01:00.465">liar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却从未见过这样的说谎者</span></p><p begin="01:00.475" end="01:03.652" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:00.475" end="01:01.231">生まれつき</span><span begin="01:01.231" end="01:02.115">たっての</span><span begin="01:02.115" end="01:02.807">底</span><span begin="01:02.807" end="01:03.652">なし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与生俱来的贪得无厌</span></p><p begin="01:03.662" end="01:05.021" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:03.662" end="01:03.874">This</span> <span begin="01:03.874" end="01:04.157">lie</span> <span begin="01:04.157" end="01:04.374">is</span> <span begin="01:04.374" end="01:05.021">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谎言便是爱 这个谎言便是给予世界的礼物</span></p><p begin="01:05.021" end="01:07.564" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:05.021" end="01:05.403">And this</span> <span begin="01:05.403" end="01:05.830">lie</span> <span begin="01:05.830" end="01:06.064">is a</span> <span begin="01:06.064" end="01:06.549">gift</span> <span begin="01:06.549" end="01:06.894">to the</span> <span begin="01:06.894" end="01:07.564">world</span></p><p begin="01:07.155" end="01:11.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:07.155" end="01:07.600">誰と</span><span begin="01:07.600" end="01:08.619">生きたか</span><span begin="01:08.619" end="01:09.264">思い</span><span begin="01:09.264" end="01:09.946">出し</span><span begin="01:09.946" end="01:11.086">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赶快回想起来 何人曾与我相伴</span></p><p begin="01:10.517" end="01:16.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:10.517" end="01:11.630">わたしが</span><span begin="01:11.630" end="01:12.678">命</span><span begin="01:12.678" end="01:13.052">を</span><span begin="01:13.052" end="01:13.965">賭けるか</span><span begin="01:13.965" end="01:14.836">ら</span> <span begin="01:14.836" end="01:15.623">あげるか</span><span begin="01:15.623" end="01:16.993">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿赌上我的生命</span></p><p begin="01:16.993" end="01:22.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:16.993" end="01:18.138">あなたは</span><span begin="01:18.138" end="01:19.180">時間</span><span begin="01:19.180" end="01:19.665">を</span><span begin="01:19.665" end="01:20.419">くれたの</span><span begin="01:20.419" end="01:20.785">で</span><span begin="01:20.785" end="01:22.132">しょう？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你将生命的时光留给了我 对吗？</span></p><p begin="01:22.132" end="01:28.957" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:22.132" end="01:22.930">あらゆる</span><span begin="01:23.315" end="01:24.408">望みの</span><span begin="01:24.408" end="01:25.150">総</span><span begin="01:25.150" end="01:25.913">てを</span><span begin="01:25.913" end="01:26.774">叶えた</span><span begin="01:26.774" end="01:27.231">ら</span> <span begin="01:27.231" end="01:27.674">ああ</span><span begin="01:27.674" end="01:28.957">果たせたら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等我亲手实现了所有的期望</span></p><p begin="01:29.771" end="01:32.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:29.771" end="01:30.842">あなたに</span><span begin="01:30.842" end="01:32.441">会いたい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想与你相见</span></p><p begin="01:32.451" end="01:35.517" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:32.451" end="01:33.678">星に願いを</span><span begin="01:33.678" end="01:34.370">かけ</span><span begin="01:34.370" end="01:35.517">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向星明许下祈愿</span></p><p begin="01:35.950" end="01:39.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:35.950" end="01:37.384">戻れないから</span><span begin="01:37.384" end="01:38.014">大切に</span><span begin="01:38.014" end="01:38.532">する</span><span begin="01:38.532" end="01:39.211">の？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为时间无法倒流才懂得珍惜吗？</span></p><p begin="01:39.211" end="01:42.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:39.211" end="01:40.514">始めないなら</span><span begin="01:40.514" end="01:41.090">高を</span><span begin="01:41.090" end="01:41.796">括れる</span><span begin="01:41.796" end="01:42.320">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法开始 那就不要心存芥蒂</span></p><p begin="01:42.320" end="01:44.965" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:42.320" end="01:43.684">らくになる日は</span><span begin="01:43.684" end="01:44.399">まず来な</span><span begin="01:44.399" end="01:44.965">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻松的日常根本不可能到来</span></p><p begin="01:44.965" end="01:52.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:44.965" end="01:45.599">日々の</span><span begin="01:45.830" end="01:46.478">なかに</span><span begin="01:46.798" end="01:47.465">集ま</span><span begin="01:47.465" end="01:48.607">る</span><span begin="01:48.810" end="01:49.821">悲しい</span><span begin="01:49.821" end="01:52.779">光</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活点滴中凝聚悲伤的星光</span></p><p begin="01:53.127" end="01:56.409" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:53.127" end="01:54.052">生まれつき</span><span begin="01:54.052" end="01:54.988">だってば</span><span begin="01:54.988" end="01:55.589">底</span><span begin="01:55.589" end="01:56.409">なし</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自降生之初便是无尽谎言</span></p><p begin="01:56.419" end="01:57.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:56.419" end="01:56.631">This</span> <span begin="01:56.631" end="01:56.914">lie</span> <span begin="01:56.914" end="01:57.131">is</span> <span begin="01:57.131" end="01:57.778">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谎言便是爱 这个谎言便是给予世界的礼物</span></p><p begin="01:57.778" end="02:00.321" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:57.778" end="01:58.160">And this</span> <span begin="01:58.160" end="01:58.587">lie</span> <span begin="01:58.587" end="01:58.821">is a</span> <span begin="01:58.821" end="01:59.306">gift</span> <span begin="01:59.306" end="01:59.651">to the</span> <span begin="01:59.651" end="02:00.321">world</span></p><p begin="01:59.990" end="02:03.668" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:59.990" end="02:00.476">誰を</span><span begin="02:00.476" end="02:01.461">生きたか</span><span begin="02:01.461" end="02:02.023">忘れ</span><span begin="02:02.023" end="02:02.888">ちゃっ</span><span begin="02:02.888" end="02:03.668">た！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">早已忘却自己曾经是谁</span></p><p begin="02:28.932" end="02:34.535" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:28.932" end="02:30.136">あなたに</span><span begin="02:30.136" end="02:31.051">命</span><span begin="02:31.051" end="02:31.504">が</span><span begin="02:31.504" end="02:32.381">戻るな</span><span begin="02:32.381" end="02:33.055">ら</span> <span begin="02:33.161" end="02:33.897">届くな</span><span begin="02:33.897" end="02:34.535">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要得以挽回你的生命 只要能够实现</span></p><p begin="02:35.335" end="02:40.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:35.335" end="02:36.550">わたしは</span><span begin="02:36.550" end="02:38.040">どうなろうと</span><span begin="02:38.040" end="02:39.598">構わないの</span><span begin="02:39.598" end="02:40.539">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕不顾一切拼尽所有</span></p><p begin="02:41.832" end="02:46.123" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:41.832" end="02:42.991">どうやら</span><span begin="02:42.991" end="02:43.595">総</span><span begin="02:43.595" end="02:44.440">ては</span><span begin="02:44.440" end="02:45.227">叶わな</span><span begin="02:45.227" end="02:46.123">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看来所有的愿望仍然无法实现</span></p><p begin="02:46.131" end="02:50.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:46.131" end="02:47.169">叶わない</span><span begin="02:47.169" end="02:47.744">ならば</span><span begin="02:48.115" end="02:49.274">あなたに</span><span begin="02:49.274" end="02:50.794">なりたい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">既然无法实现 那我愿意成为你的化身</span></p><p begin="02:50.804" end="02:54.397" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:50.804" end="02:51.844">星は砕け</span><span begin="02:51.844" end="02:52.552">光</span><span begin="02:52.552" end="02:54.397">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰陨落 仍旧闪耀</span></p><p begin="02:52.902" end="02:59.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:52.902" end="02:54.015">わたしが</span><span begin="02:54.015" end="02:55.063">命</span><span begin="02:55.063" end="02:55.437">を</span><span begin="02:55.437" end="02:56.350">賭けるか</span><span begin="02:56.350" end="02:57.221">ら</span> <span begin="02:57.221" end="02:58.008">あげるか</span><span begin="02:58.008" end="02:59.378">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿赌上我的生命</span></p><p begin="02:59.319" end="03:04.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:59.319" end="03:00.464">あなたは</span><span begin="03:00.464" end="03:01.506">時間</span><span begin="03:01.506" end="03:01.991">を</span><span begin="03:01.991" end="03:02.745">くれたの</span><span begin="03:02.745" end="03:03.111">で</span><span begin="03:03.111" end="03:04.458">しょう？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你将生命的时光留给了我 对吗？</span></p><p begin="03:04.509" end="03:11.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="03:04.509" end="03:05.307">あらゆる</span><span begin="03:05.692" end="03:06.785">望みの</span><span begin="03:06.785" end="03:07.527">総</span><span begin="03:07.527" end="03:08.290">てを</span><span begin="03:08.290" end="03:09.151">叶えた</span><span begin="03:09.151" end="03:09.608">ら</span> <span begin="03:09.608" end="03:10.051">ああ</span><span begin="03:10.051" end="03:11.334">果たせたら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等我亲手实现了所有的期望</span></p><p begin="03:12.213" end="03:14.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:12.213" end="03:13.284">あなたに</span><span begin="03:13.284" end="03:14.883">会いたい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想与你相见</span></p><p begin="03:14.787" end="03:17.853" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:14.787" end="03:16.014">星に願いを</span><span begin="03:16.014" end="03:16.706">かけ</span><span begin="03:16.706" end="03:17.853">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向星明许下祈愿</span></p><p begin="03:17.633" end="03:23.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:17.633" end="03:18.186">さあ</span><span begin="03:18.186" end="03:19.245">星の子たち</span><span begin="03:19.245" end="03:19.954">よ</span> <span begin="03:20.178" end="03:20.712">よく</span><span begin="03:20.712" end="03:21.550">お眠り</span><span begin="03:21.550" end="03:22.047">なさ</span><span begin="03:22.047" end="03:23.057">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰的孩子们啊</span></p><p begin="03:24.352" end="03:29.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:24.352" end="03:25.380">輝きは</span><span begin="03:25.380" end="03:26.475">鈍らない</span> <span begin="03:26.723" end="03:27.393">あなたた</span><span begin="03:27.393" end="03:27.942">ち</span><span begin="03:27.942" end="03:28.530">なら</span><span begin="03:28.530" end="03:29.562">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">炽烈光辉永不黯淡</span></p><p begin="03:30.449" end="03:36.168" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:30.449" end="03:31.013">さあ</span><span begin="03:31.013" end="03:32.076">星の子たち</span><span begin="03:32.076" end="03:32.586">よ</span> <span begin="03:33.027" end="03:33.522">よく</span><span begin="03:33.522" end="03:34.513">狙い</span><span begin="03:34.513" end="03:35.145">なさ</span><span begin="03:35.145" end="03:36.168">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰的孩子们啊</span></p><p begin="03:37.105" end="03:43.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:37.105" end="03:38.039">またたきを</span><span begin="03:38.039" end="03:39.093">許さない</span> <span begin="03:39.394" end="03:40.180">あなたた</span><span begin="03:40.180" end="03:40.901">ち</span><span begin="03:40.901" end="03:41.638">なら</span><span begin="03:41.638" end="03:43.191">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不容转瞬之间的怠慢</span></p></div></body></tt>